            "text": "Attach the nose cone to the open front of the fuselage. Position both wings at the widest point of the fuselage, one on each side, angled slightly back. Sew the horizontal tail fin to the rear and the vertical fin upright on top. Embroider oval portholes in blue yarn along each side."
